{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|Bron$ze Sword}}

Armor penetration: 12.5 %

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{_{q}Bronze * 9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>

* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = (Weapon Base Damage)*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Sword}/10}</math>.

